{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:21:175","content":{"id":175,"title":"18 胸腺 -- 杀手大师","content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"适应性免疫细胞需要从胸腺这所“杀手大学”中毕业，比如 T 细胞。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_841f3e04-7d09-4dce-a395-9e74a1922565.png","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_841f3e04-7d09-4dce-a395-9e74a1922565.png"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"每个 T 细胞生来都有某一特殊受体，可以识别某一种特殊抗原，肯定有很多 T 细胞的受体可以与自身细胞的蛋白结合，这就是自身免疫性疾病。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"blockquote","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"自身免疫性疾病就是适应性免疫系统把自身细胞当成了敌人和异物"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"T 细胞在胸腺接受训练："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"确保 T 细胞能够生成有效的 T 细胞受体"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"查看 T 细胞是否擅长识别合作细胞的受体"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"T 细胞会不会识别自身的细胞"}],"disableDrag":false}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"胸腺中存在只有在心脏、胰腺、肝脏等器官中才会出现的蛋白质，以及各种激素，如胰岛素，如果 T 细胞能识别其中任何一种，就会被干掉。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"胸腺在关停过程中，在幼儿期就开始萎缩、青春期退化的更快，到了 85 岁左右，就永久关停了，从此免疫力大大减弱，此时只能靠成熟的 T 细胞。"}],"disableDrag":false}],"breadcrumb":[{"label":"《战斗细胞》","target":{"key":"doc:project:21:170","type":"doc","id":170}},{"label":"第二部分，惨重损伤"},{"label":"18 胸腺 -- 杀手大师","target":{"key":"doc:project:21:175","type":"doc","id":175}}],"prevPage":{"title":"17 烹饪美味的受体菜谱","target":{"key":"doc:project:21:174","type":"doc","id":174}},"nextPage":{"title":"19 抗原层递","target":{"key":"doc:project:21:203","type":"doc","id":203}},"createTime":1740095614307,"updateTime":1756124014308,"projectId":21},"meta":{"type":"doc","publishTime":1756124014308}}